{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1395521-still-making-an-adventure-and-just-thought-i-d-share","id":1395521,"title":"Still making an adventure and just thought I'd share","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-09T21:22:32-07:00","id":1395521,"title":"Still making an adventure and just thought I'd share","content":"So, I'm still making that mage adventure I said I would. <br /> <br /> I made what I think is a decent cover.<br /> Edit: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VwWlS7y8D3BISBNooipVvst5nVExbrMT/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VwW...ew?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> I've written an introduction and a page of mundane history plus 2 pages of secret history. <br /> <br /> I have some NPCs, an outline of the story, some side adventures and possible events and such. That's where I'm at.<br /> <br /> Writing a game you'll run for a bunch of friends and a game someone else might run for people who might have never even heard of the setting of your game sure is different. <br /> <br /> I find myself explaining things I didn't realize I might need to but leaving out stuff that, though accurate, will gave little if any bearing on a game. <br /> <br /> It's fun though. It also gives perspective on all the trouble it took for the pros to make the previous books. <br /> <br /> Just thought I'd share.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","user":"Spacecat","date":". 06-10-2020, 10:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-10T13:00:24-07:00","id":1395654,"title":"","content":"Keep at it. Also, since Mage is a game with many options and you're not making a competition adventure, I'd focus on the few things an adversary might need to counter when developing their tactics for conflict situations.<br /> <br /> It's tough knowing what to put in and keep out of an adventure--in general I try and think of what an intelligent player would ask and answer that briefly for the other GM.<br /> <br /> Good organization really helps--when we started getting HackMaster Association adventures fine-tuned, we had summaries of what successfully completed each encounter (call them scenes) and the rewards for each scene at the end of the adventure. That way, it wasn't lost in the flavor text.<br /> <br /> Definitely run the adventure by a few other Mage fans before publishing for comments and when doing so, you'll get better feedback if you let them know which areas you are less sure are great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-10T16:14:09-07:00","id":1395685,"title":"","content":"Thanks. Great advice. So far it's a glorious mess. But it's starting to shape into something playable. I have no way of testing it out in the near future though (no mage players, quarantine, stuff). Also so far, the baddies seem kinda static. I'm trying to make Avatar storm mutated WW2 ghosts interesting. They're not the final problem, but they're supposed to serve as an obvious bad guy and an obstacle for tackling the main tasks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}